{"s":[[null,1,[["g",[[null,0,[],"Feast_of_the_Winterstar.png"]]],["p",["The Feast of the Winter Star is a ",["l","节日","festival"]," that takes place on the 25th of every ",["l","冬季","Winter"],". The player attends the festival by entering ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"]," between 9am and 2pm. When the player leaves the festival, they will be returned to ",["l","农场","The Farm"]," at 10pm."]],["p",["The main event of the Feast of the Winter Star is secret gift-giving. A random ",["l","居民","villager"]," will be selected to give the player a gift, and the player is assigned a random villager to give a gift to. A week beforehand, on the 18th, ",["l","刘易斯","Mayor Lewis"]," will send a letter telling the player who their gift recipient is. The player finds out who is giving them a gift at the festival."]],["p",["The festival ends when the player leaves ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"],"."]]]],["Shop",2,[["p",[["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]," has a booth from which he sells the following items."]]]],["Fixed Stock",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Price"]}],[[["f","Winter_Banner.png",24]],[["l","冬季帘子","Winter Banner"]],["Can be placed inside your house."],["1,000g"]],[[["f","L._Light_String.png",36]],[["l","小灯串","L. Light String"]],["Can be placed inside your house."],["800g"]],[[["f","S._Pine.png",36]],[["l","小型松树","S. Pine"]],["Can be placed as decoration."],["500g"]],[[["f","Ornate_Window.png",36]],[["l","华丽窗户","Ornate Window"]],["Can be placed inside your house."],["1,000g"]],[[["f","House_Plant_7.png",36]],[["l","家居植物","House Plant"]],["Can be placed as decoration."],["700g"]],[[["f","Festive_Dining_Table.png",36]],[["l","节日餐桌","Festive Dining Table"]],["Can be placed as decoration."],["3,000g"]],[[["f","Large_Red_Rug.png",36]],[["l","大号红色地毯","Large Red Rug"]],["Can be placed inside your house."],["1,000g"]],[[["f","Decorative_Axe.png",24]],[["l","装饰斧头","Decorative Axe"]],["Can be placed inside your house."],["1,000g"]],[[["f"