",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", or ",["l","威利","Willy"]]],[[["f","Tea_Set.png",32]],[["l","茶具","Tea Set"]],["1"],["Any adult except ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", or ",["l","威利","Willy"]]],[[["f","Pink_Cake.png",32]],[["l","粉红蛋糕","Pink Cake"]],["1"],["Any adult except ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", or ",["l","威利","Willy"]]],[[["f","Ruby.png",32]],[["l","红宝石","Ruby"]],["1"],["Any adult except ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", or ",["l","威利","Willy"]]],[[["f","Emerald.png",32]],[["l","绿宝石","Emerald"]],["1"],["Any adult except ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", or ",["l","威利","Willy"]]],[[["f","Jade.png",32]],[["l","翡翠","Jade"]],["1"],["Any adult except ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", or ",["l","威利","Willy"]]]]]]],["Mail",2,[["q",["Dear [Player],\nI would like to give you some information about an upcoming event: the Feast of the Winter Star. It's a time for the community to come together and think back on all the good fortune we've had this year.\nA favorite tradition is the \"secret gift exchange\", where everyone in town is randomly assigned to someone else. On the day of the festival, everyone brings a gift for their secret friend and surprises them with something special!\nThis year, your secret friend is:\n[Villager]\nDon't tell anyone! The feast will take place on the 25th from 9AM to 2PM at the town square. See you then!\n-Mayor Lewis"],[]]]],["Trivia",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Speaking to ",["l","威利","Willy"]," gives the player the option to hear the story of the Winter Star:","\n","\"In the night sky of winter, there is a bright star only visible from this valley. No one knows why this is... but in times of old people would come from far and wide to see it. They believed that anyone who laid eyes on the Winter Star would be blessed with good fortune. Some even claim that the mysterious fruit known as ",["l","星之果实","Stardrop"]," is connected to the Winter Star in some way.\""]],[1,["On the ",["l","彩蛋","shipping summary screen"]," at end of the 24th day of Winter, Santa Claus will ride across the sky with a few reindeer in his sleigh."]],[1,["If the player talks to ",["l","乔治","George"],", he will deprecate the feast and shout \"Humbug!\", a reference to Ebenezer Scrooge, the elderly protagonist of Charles Dickens' novel A Christmas Carol."]],[1,["It is possible to have your secret friend be ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],". If that happens, Lewis will still send you a letter telling you so, and will still act surprised when you give him his gift."]]]]]],["Bugs",2,[["l",0,[[1,["It's possible for ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]," to be the secret friend after the player meets him but before he moves from ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"]," to the mainland. In this case, Leo does not attend the festival, so the player cannot give him a gift (and then cannot receive a gift)."]]]]]]]}